  "notable_quotes": [
    "Flexible-robust MOFs combine rigid and flexible advantages: multistep isotherms preserve rigid pores between transitions and improve low-pressure uptake.",
    "At low pressure (<10 kPa), steep C2 adsorption isotherms at 273-323 K indicate strong guest-framework interactions in Zn2(Atz)2Ox.",
    "Flexible MOFs generally have low low-pressure uptake, making them inefficient for removing trace impurities."
  ],
